        "id": "program-goal",
        "moduleId": "program-setup",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材示例的目标与初始画面",
        "markdown": "教材用一个连续的程序段演示如何对一个矩形依次应用各种基本几何变换，每次只做一种。程序开始时把当前矩阵模式设为建模观察矩阵，当前矩阵是单位矩阵；此时用蓝色绘制矩形 `glRecti(50, 100, 200, 150)`，屏幕上出现一个未变换的蓝色矩形。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000250"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "OpenGL 几何变换编程示例"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6866,
              "lineEnd": 6893,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/066d2036f7ed9fa5f5bfb758821e27845ef01d6e6eabfb57e990564e45f1c324.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/5df4ef7b291eeb0c8b76f60bf039c54d143726c4d2d68761f6b017e7b760f836.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/b80b449d374987f6fe07ad6dbec7614c06a6d0013a04d4a090693782eec7c2e4.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "6a132333fa9c159b22c8169060fc761ceef1b0ef72654ac8271d1a28dd2c0591"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-transform-pipeline",
        "moduleId": "program-setup",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "矩阵在什么时候影响矩形",
        "markdown": "OpenGL 并不保存一个可移动的“矩形对象”，每次 `glRecti` 提交的顶点都会与当时生效的建模观察矩阵相乘，然后再进入后续流水线。因此决定几何效果的不是矩形坐标本身，而是绘制调用发生那一刻的当前矩阵。建模观察矩阵同时承担模型变换和观察变换，本节的示例只改动其中的模型变换部分。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "program-goal"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "translation-code-walk",
        "moduleId": "translation-demo",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "平移示例的代码序列",
        "markdown": "接下来程序把颜色改为红色，指定二维平移参数，再重新提交同一个矩形：\n\n```c\nglColor3f(1.0, 0.0, 0.0);\nglTranslatef(-200.0, -50.0, 0.0); // 设定平移参数\nglRecti(50, 100, 200, 150);       // 显示红色、平移后的矩形\n```\n\n结果对应图 7.34。由于这一步只做平移、不需要组合其他变换，教材随后直接把当前矩阵重新设回单位矩阵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000250"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "OpenGL 几何变换编程示例"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6866,
              "lineEnd": 6893,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/066d2036f7ed9fa5f5bfb758821e27845ef01d6e6eabfb57e990564e45f1c324.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/5df4ef7b291eeb0c8b76f60bf039c54d143726c4d2d68761f6b017e7b760f836.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/b80b449d374987f6fe07ad6dbec7614c06a6d0013a04d4a090693782eec7c2e4.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "6a132333fa9c159b22c8169060fc761ceef1b0ef72654ac8271d1a28dd2c0591"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-translation-effect",
        "moduleId": "translation-demo",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "平移参数如何读",
        "markdown": "平移量 $(-200, -50)$ 使矩形沿 $x$ 轴负方向移动 200 个单位、沿 $y$ 轴负方向移动 50 个单位，矩形的形状和朝向保持不变。因为 `glTranslatef` 生成的是矩阵而不是立刻搬运像素，它只对之后提交的顶点生效，所以必须先设置矩阵、再调用 `glRecti`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "translation-code-walk"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "identity-reset",
        "moduleId": "reset-and-rotation",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "复位矩阵、旋转与缩放",
        "markdown": "接着程序调用 `glLoadIdentity()` 把当前矩阵恢复为单位矩阵，再构造绕 $z$ 轴旋转 $90^\\circ$ 的矩阵并与当前矩阵合并，然后重新提交原始矩形；矩形绕原点旋转后以红色显示，如图 7.35。对缩放与反射重复同样的过程：再次 `glLoadIdentity()` 后调用 `glScalef(-0.5, 1.0, 1.0)`，得到图 7.36 中的缩放与反射结果。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000250"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "OpenGL 几何变换编程示例"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6866,
              "lineEnd": 6893,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/066d2036f7ed9fa5f5bfb758821e27845ef01d6e6eabfb57e990564e45f1c324.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/5df4ef7b291eeb0c8b76f60bf039c54d143726c4d2d68761f6b017e7b760f836.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/b80b449d374987f6fe07ad6dbec7614c06a6d0013a04d4a090693782eec7c2e4.jpg"
              ],
